{
  "summary": "## Overview\nA fixture brief for the browser suite: two change groups over three files, with a risk surface, a diff per chunk, and a second revision to compare against. The accessibility pass lifts the faint text token, adds a skip-to-content link and promotes the PR title to the page's only `h1`, while the keyboard work wires J/K chunk stepping and a `?` shortcuts modal.\n\n## Changelog\n- **Accessibility & brand:** lifts the faint text token to a passing contrast ratio and adds a skip-to-content link.\n- **Keyboard navigation:** J/K step through chunks; `?` opens the shortcuts modal.\n- **Landmarks:** the brief body becomes `#main-content`, focused on load so screen readers start at the summary.\n- **Risk flags:** `addressFlags` is indexed by chunk id, so the perf helpers no longer rescan every flag per row.\n- **Metadata:** favicon, description and OG/Twitter tags for shared links.",
